Well, that's all but the caveman! I set out to go vegan and
never hit with a wielded weapon as a minimum. I soon decided
wishless as well would endanger my primary objective which
was to ascend a monk but I did hold to the semi-conduct of
not using any /oWishing. Finding Magicbane and the Eye of
the Aethiopica in bones piles made it much easier.

At first glance I was pleased with the starting roll, but
after some reflection, strength is the easiest stat to
advance and intelligence one of the hardest and I would need
intelligence to acquire spells even though wisdom would be
used to cast them (I hope I got that right) and good
charisma would be needed to help in the encounters with
foocubi to gain XLs past 13 or 14. Oh, well. :(

